  "question": {
    "html": "<p>The intensity of radiation emitted by a black body is maximum when the wavelength is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"W\"></span>. At what wavelength is the intensity of the emitted radiation maximum when the temperature of the black body is halved, assuming that no other changes are made?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{W}{4}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{W}{2}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2W\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4W\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
